{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/TXT1.png?t=1752072884\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/S0_GIF_1_op.gif?t=1752072884\" /></div>SECTOR ZERO is a reverse horror first-person physics-based puzzle platformer inspired by classics like Portal, Half-Life, and Alien vs. Predator. The story is set in space, inside of a huge asteroid which is being mined for its resources by human colonists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/TXT2.png?t=1752072884\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/S0_GIF_2_op.gif?t=1752072884\" /></div>The miners were too greedy, dug too deep and, in the core of the asteroid, they discovered you - the Player - an alien hive mind entity called &quot;The Corruption,&quot; which was awoken from its slumber and is now angry. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/TXT3.png?t=1752072884\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/S0_GIF_3_op.gif?t=1752072884\" /></div>There are loads of lasers, turrets, and other security measures standing in your way. However, your one critical advantage is the ability to corrupt and control all human-made machinery. This can give you the upper hand in platforming sequences or when solving various physics-based puzzles.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/TXT4.png?t=1752072884\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/S0_GIF_4_op.gif?t=1752072884\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a monster! Jump, climb and crawl through the environments! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maneuver around lasers, hide from turrets and sneak around enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Posses human made technology and use it to your advantage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with your surroundings by pushing, pulling and biting objects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller &amp; Steam Deck supported!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2352050?t=1752072884","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2352050?t=1752072884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752072884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752072884","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/TXT1.png?t=1752072884\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/S0_GIF_1_op.gif?t=1752072884\" /></div>SECTOR ZERO is a reverse horror first-person physics-based puzzle platformer inspired by classics like Portal, Half-Life, and Alien vs. Predator. The story is set in space, inside of a huge asteroid which is being mined for its resources by human colonists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/TXT2.png?t=1752072884\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/S0_GIF_2_op.gif?t=1752072884\" /></div>The miners were too greedy, dug too deep and, in the core of the asteroid, they discovered you - the Player - an alien hive mind entity called &quot;The Corruption,&quot; which was awoken from its slumber and is now angry. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/TXT3.png?t=1752072884\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/S0_GIF_3_op.gif?t=1752072884\" /></div>There are loads of lasers, turrets, and other security measures standing in your way. However, your one critical advantage is the ability to corrupt and control all human-made machinery. This can give you the upper hand in platforming sequences or when solving various physics-based puzzles.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/TXT4.png?t=1752072884\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/extras/S0_GIF_4_op.gif?t=1752072884\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a monster! Jump, climb and crawl through the environments! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maneuver around lasers, hide from turrets and sneak around enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Posses human made technology and use it to your advantage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with your surroundings by pushing, pulling and biting objects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller &amp; Steam Deck supported!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Ondrej Angelovic"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352050/header.jpg?t=1752072884","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 | AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 660 |  AMD Radeon RX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 | AMD Ryzen 5 2600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960 |  AMD Radeon R9 380X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4gb VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4gb VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257072516,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257072516/movie480.mp4?t=1731372623","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257072516/movie_max.mp4?t=1731372623"},"name":"Story Trailer","thumbnail":"https://sha